@startuml 궁합요청_생성

autonumber

actor User as Reader
participant BoardUI as B
participant "CompatibilityController\n(Flask API)" as CC
participant "CompatibilityService" as CS
participant "CompatibilityRepository" as CR
participant "FriendRepository" as FR
participant "NotificationRepository" as NR
database DB

Reader -> B: "작성자와 궁합 요청" 클릭
B -> CC: POST /compatibility/requests {target_id, message}
CC -> CC: require_auth() - 토큰 검증
CC -> CC: get_current_user() - 현재 사용자 확인
CC -> CS: request_compatibility(requester_id, target_id, message)
CS -> CS: 본인 확인 (requester_id != target_id)
CS -> CS: _require_user(requester_id)
CS -> CS: _require_user(target_id)
CS -> FR: are_friends(requester_id, target_id)
FR -> DB: SELECT friendship WHERE (requester_id, addressee_id) AND status='accepted'
alt 친구 관계 없음
  DB --> FR: none
  FR --> CS: False
  CS --> CC: ValidationError("친구에게만 궁합 요청을 보낼 수 있습니다.")
  CC --> B: 400 Bad Request
  B --> Reader: 친구 관계 필요 안내
else 친구 관계 있음
  DB --> FR: friendship exists
  FR --> CS: True
  CS -> CR: create(requester_id, target_id, message)
  CR -> DB: INSERT compatibility_request(status='pending', request_message)
  DB --> CR: request_id
  CR --> CS: request_id
  CS -> NR: create(notification_type='compatibility_requested', ...)
  NR -> DB: INSERT notification
  DB --> NR: ok
  NR --> CS: ok
  CS --> CC: request_id
  CC --> B: 201 Created {request_id, status: "pending"}
  B --> Reader: 요청 완료
end

@enduml

